## A green matte receiver lit by a distant light, with no card shadowing it: the unshadowed
## reference for rayshadow_cutout.rib. Not third-party.
Display "rayshadow_cutout_bare.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 200 200 1
PixelSamples 2 2
Option "pathtracer" "integer samples" [16]
Projection "perspective" "fov" [90]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "distantlight" 1 "intensity" [2.0] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
	"from" [-2 0 -1] "to" [0 0 0]
Sides 2
Color [0 1 0]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [0] "Kd" [0.8]
Polygon "P" [-30 -30 3  30 -30 3  30 30 3  -30 30 3]
WorldEnd
